{"4640600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In Us", "steam_appid": 4640600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/38878188a735b811b170c0b8089e3398.avif?t=1777125991\" width=447 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The devil wears a human face. Unmask it and exorcise it—with friends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Us is a co-op horror game where you and your teammates take on the role of exorcists, tasked with cleansing a village of lurking demons. Using a variety of items, you must investigate the passing villagers, deduce whether they are human or demonic, and execute the evil among them. But beware—should you misjudge, the demons will mercilessly bare their fangs at your team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/94e01d61136745e68572e0c65515a948.avif?t=1777125991\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/cbcb36dd9504c01c5ce641b12c07f701.poster.avif?t=1777125991\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/cbcb36dd9504c01c5ce641b12c07f701.webm?t=1777125991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/cbcb36dd9504c01c5ce641b12c07f701.mp4?t=1777125991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons disguised as humans are relentlessly hunting their prey. You must make accurate decisions before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/fef093d9f286d23b42b0ffa66f13e18c.avif?t=1777125991\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/62069cd94bfb55eaa4c432204376e856.poster.avif?t=1777125991\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/62069cd94bfb55eaa4c432204376e856.webm?t=1777125991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/62069cd94bfb55eaa4c432204376e856.mp4?t=1777125991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demons come in many terrifying forms. You won't make it through the night without each other's help. Fight back through communication, role assignment, and solid teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/6bc4aa93387d7f7252e4131fc438c339.avif?t=1777125991\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/19db87bca9006e32f1fc1be80f3b9aee.poster.avif?t=1777125991\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/19db87bca9006e32f1fc1be80f3b9aee.webm?t=1777125991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/19db87bca9006e32f1fc1be80f3b9aee.mp4?t=1777125991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect the slightest changes in your environment and use your items effectively. Scopes, hymns, traps, and even an exorcist dog are your keys to uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/38878188a735b811b170c0b8089e3398.avif?t=1777125991\" width=447 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The devil wears a human face. Unmask it and exorcise it—with friends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Us is a co-op horror game where you and your teammates take on the role of exorcists, tasked with cleansing a village of lurking demons. Using a variety of items, you must investigate the passing villagers, deduce whether they are human or demonic, and execute the evil among them. But beware—should you misjudge, the demons will mercilessly bare their fangs at your team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/94e01d61136745e68572e0c65515a948.avif?t=1777125991\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640600/extras/cbcb36dd9504c01c5ce641b12c07f701.poster.avif?t=1777125991\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item